      "tables": [],
      "text": "Reg 4.15(a) prescribes the following words: Patent, Patented, By Royal Letters Patent, Protected International Trade Mark Registered, Registered Design, Copyright, Plant Breeder’s Rights, EL rights, or words or symbols to the same effect (including the symbols \"©\" and \"®\"). (For the meaning of “EL rights” see section 5 of the Circuit Layouts Act 1989.)"
